        "Every per-class recall@10 and MRR value is IDENTICAL between the old (outlier) and new (this file) measurement except overall MRR (0.5582->0.5420) and exact-identifier MRR (0.9259->0.8611) -- the two metrics flagged as anomalous, and only those two.",
