        "README.md's current text (as of this investigation, likely edited independently by p6-docfix before this confirmation landed) already cites exact-identifier MRR as '\u22480.86' and overall MRR as '\u22480.54' -- both match this regeneration closely (0.856, 0.541), suggesting docfix had independently converged on the same conclusion."
